  testing Wording.normalise(line, "").isBlank(): ./mvnw -o -q test -Dtest=GeneratedBlocksTests#aLineHoldingOnlyUnicodeSpaceSeparatorsIsSkippedAndTheLeadInAboveItIsScreened
