  causal wording, found "led"] ... could not find the following elements: [...:1 ... found "caused"", "...:5 ... found "Every""]": the lead-ins above the
  U+00A0 and U+202F lines were not screened, the one above U+2003 (Character.isWhitespace) was. Fix: Wording.blank(text) is true when every code point of
